# 45. A More Precise Definition

综合上述，我建议你在自己的分享 / 报告中采用这个定义：

> **Recursive Self-Improvement is a closed or progressively closing feedback process in which an AI system uses its own capabilities, experience, artifacts, evaluations, or research outputs to modify the system that produces those capabilities, such that subsequent generations become not only more capable at target tasks but also more capable at producing further improvements.**

中文：

> **递归自我改进，是一种正在闭合或逐步闭合的反馈过程：AI 利用自身能力、经验、产物、评价或研究结果，修改产生这些能力的系统，使后续系统不仅在目标任务上能力更强，而且具备更强的进一步改进自身的能力。**

这个定义比：

> “AI improves itself”

严格得多。

